umlah murid</span><select class=\"w-full bg-transparent text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 focus:outline-none cursor-pointer\"><option value=\"small\">Kurang dari 300</option><option value=\"mid\" selected=\"\">300 sampai 800</option><option value=\"big\">Lebih dari 800</option></select></label><button type=\"submit\" class=\"min-h-12 px-8 rounded-full bg-indigo-700 hover:bg-indigo-800 text-white font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center gap-2 active:scale-95 transition\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search w-4 h-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg> Cari Paket</button></form></div></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-4 flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Absensi Cepat</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Cukup beberapa ketukan dari HP.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-4 flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check-corner lucide-file-check-2 w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10.5 22H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.706.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v6\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5\"></path><path d=\"m14 20 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Izin Online</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Orang tua mengajukan izin lengkap dengan bukti.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-4 flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Data Aman</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Terpisah per sekolah, akses sesuai peran.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white/80 rounded-2xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-4 flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold\">Tanpa Instal</p><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 mt-0.5\">Dibuka dari browser, bisa ke layar utama.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"tentang\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-16 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase\">Kenapa <!-- -->NamaAplikasi</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black leading-tight\">Lebih dari Sekadar Absensi</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">Kami menyatukan absensi, izin, dan pemantauan dalam satu aplikasi yang bisa dipakai guru, orang tua, kepala sekolah, dan admin.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 space-y-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Guru mengabsen satu kelas lebih cepat</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Orang tua langsung tahu kehadiran dan status izin anak</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Kepala sekolah melihat tren dan murid yang perlu perhatian</li><li class=\"flex gap-3 text-sm text-gray-800\"><span class=\"w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-indigo-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-3 h-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg></span>Pilihan paket sesuai kebijakan HP di sekolah</li></ul><a href=\"#fitur\" class=\"mt-7 inline-flex items-center min-h-11 px-6 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 hover:bg-indigo-900 text-white text-sm font-bold active:scale-95 transition\">Lihat Fitur</a></div><div class=\"relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden aspect-[4/3] shadow-lg bg-indigo-100\"><img src=\"/tentang.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\"/></div></section><section id=\"fitur\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-20\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-center\">Satu aplikasi, empat peran</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 p-6 shadow-sm\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clipboard-check w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"8\" height=\"4\" x=\"8\" y=\"2\" rx=\"1\" ry=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M16 4h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"m9 14 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-bold\">Guru</h3><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Presensi harian per kelas dari HP</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Status Hadir, Terlambat, Izin, Sakit, Alpa</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Hasil scan QR dan izin disetujui terisi otomatis</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 p-6 shadow-sm\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-bold\">Orang tua</h3><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Lihat rekap kehadiran anak</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Ajukan izin sakit atau izin, lengkap dengan foto atau PDF</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Daftar sendiri dengan kode dari sekolah</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 p-6 shadow-sm\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column lucide-bar-chart-3 w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-bold\">Kepala sekolah</h3><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Kehadiran hari ini dan tren 7 hari</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Persentase kehadiran per kelas</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Peringatan murid yang sering Alpa</li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 p-6 shadow-sm\"><span class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-school w-5 h-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\"></path><path d=\"M18 4.933V21\"></path><path d=\"m4 6 7.106-3.79a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6\"></path><path d=\"m6 11-3.52 2.147a1 1 0 0 0-.48.854V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-.48-.853L18 11\"></path><path d=\"M6 4.933V21\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-bold\">Admin sekolah</h3><ul class=\"mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-600\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Kelola guru, murid, dan kelas</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Setujui atau tolak izin</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Buat akun dan kode pendaftaran, nonaktifkan akun</li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"paket\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-20\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase\">Paket</p><h2 class=\"mt-1 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-center\">Pilih sesuai kebijakan HP di sekolah Anda</h2><div class=\"mt-8\"><div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm transition border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"relative h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-indigo-700 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap w-14 h-14 text-white/90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg><span class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 text-indigo-700 rounded-full px-3 py-1\">Dasar</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-lg\">Mode 1<!-- --> <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-indigo-700\">Dasar</span></h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">Guru, orang tua, admin, dan kepala sekolah. Murid hanya sebagai data.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1\">4 peran</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1\">Tanpa akun murid</span></div><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Presensi harian</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Izin orang tua dengan bukti</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Dashboard kepala sekolah</li></ul><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900\">Hubungi kami</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20dengan%20Mode%201%20(Dasar).%20Boleh%20minta%20penawaran%3F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-4 min-h-10 leading-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 hover:bg-indigo-900 text-white text-xs font-bold\">Tanya harga</a></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm transition border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"relative h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-fuchsia-600 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-14 h-14 text-white/90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><span class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 text-indigo-700 rounded-full px-3 py-1\">Menengah</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-lg\">Mode 2<!-- --> <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-indigo-700\">Murid melihat rekap</span></h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">Cocok untuk sekolah yang melarang murid membawa HP.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1\">5 peran</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1\">Akun murid</span></div><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Semua fitur Mode 1</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Login murid memakai NISN</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Murid melihat rekap kehadirannya</li></ul><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900\">Hubungi kami</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20dengan%20Mode%202%20(Murid%20melihat%20rekap).%20Boleh%20minta%20penawaran%3F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-4 min-h-10 leading-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 hover:bg-indigo-900 text-white text-xs font-bold\">Tanya harga</a></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm transition border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"relative h-36 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-qr-code w-14 h-14 text-white/90\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"16\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M21 16h-3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M21 21v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 3h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 16v.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 21v-1\"></path></svg><span class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 text-[11px] font-bold bg-white/90 text-indigo-700 rounded-full px-3 py-1\">Lengkap</span></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-black text-lg\">Mode 3<!-- --> <span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-indigo-700\">Absen QR</span></h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">Untuk sekolah yang membolehkan HP. Murid menunjukkan QR, petugas memindai.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1\">5 peran</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1\">QR + scanner</span></div><ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-sm text-gray-700\"><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Semua fitur Mode 2</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>QR berganti otomatis (anti titip absen)</li><li class=\"flex gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Terlambat tercatat otomatis</li></ul><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900\">Hubungi kami</span><a href=\"https://wa.me/6281234567890?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20tertarik%20dengan%20Mode%203%20(Absen%20QR).%20Boleh%20minta%20penawaran%3F\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"px-4 min-h-10 leading-10 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950 hover:bg-indigo-900 text-white text-xs font-bold\">Tanya harga</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><p class=\"mt-4 text-center text-xs text-gray-500\">Harga berlangganan per sekolah per bulan. Hubungi kami untuk penawaran.</p></section><section id=\"cara-kerja\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-20\"><p class=\"text-center text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-indigo-600 uppercase\">Cara kerja</p><h2 class=\"mt-1 text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-center\">Mulai dalam 3 langkah mudah</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-6 flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"w-14 h-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-violet-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-school w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 21v-3a2 2 0 0 0-4 0v3\"></path><path d=\"M18 4.933V21\"></path><path d=\"m4 6 7.106-3.79a2 2 0 0 1 1.788 0L20 6\"></path><path d=\"m6 11-3.52 2.147a1 1 0 0 0-.48.854V19a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-5a1 1 0 0 0-.48-.853L18 11\"></path><path d=\"M6 4.933V21\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-xs font-black text-indigo-500\">01</p><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Sekolah didaftarkan</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">Kami membuat akun sekolah dan admin. Admin mengisi kelas, guru, dan siswa.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-6 flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"w-14 h-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-violet-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-xs font-black text-indigo-500\">02</p><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Pengguna masuk</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">Guru, orang tua, dan murid login dari HP. Orang tua daftar dengan kode dari sekolah.</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-indigo-50 shadow-sm p-6 flex items-start gap-4\"><span class=\"w-14 h-14 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-violet-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column lucide-bar-chart-3 w-6 h-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></span><div><p class=\"text-xs font-black text-indigo-500\">03</p><h3 class=\"font-bold\">Pantau dan setujui</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-gray-600\">Guru mengabsen, orang tua mengajukan izin, admin menyetujui, kepala sekolah memantau.</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"keamanan\" class=\"scroll-mt-28 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-20\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-6 h-6 text-indigo-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black\">Data siswa dijaga</h2></div><ul class=\"mt-6 grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3\"><li class=\"flex gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-indigo-50 p-4 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Password disimpan terenkripsi dan wajib diganti saat login pertama</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-indigo-50 p-4 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Percobaan login dibatasi untuk mencegah tebak password</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-indigo-50 p-4 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Hak akses dibedakan per peran</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-indigo-50 p-4 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>Data setiap sekolah terpisah</li><li class=\"flex gap-2 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-indigo-50 p-4 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg>QR murid berubah otomatis dan tidak bisa dipakai ulang dari screenshot</li></ul></section><section class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-4 mt-20\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-center\">Kata mereka</h2><div class=\"mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><figure class=\"rounded-3xl bg-white p-6 shadow-sm border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300\"><div class=\"flex gap-0.5 text-amber-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\